    <briefdescription>
<para>Renders a wireframe bounding box around the active patent model using 12 LineRenderer edges. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Visibility is toggled via PopupMenuManager.OnEnableBoundingBox and the box is automatically hidden when the model is deleted. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
